OL,3,GNEWSACouncil charged after man killed
OL,4,Aby falling tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been charged over the
OL,7,Fdeath of a football coach whose van was
OL,8,Fstruck by a falling tree during Storm
OL,9,FDarragh.
OL,11,FPaul Fiddler, who was in his 40s, died
OL,12,Fwhen the tree fell on his Citroen van
OL,13,Fas he drove along the A59 Longton
OL,14,FBypass in Hutton, Lancashire, on 7
OL,15,FDecember 2024.
OL,17,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,18,Fsaid South Ribble Borough Council was
OL,19,Fbeing prosecuted under the Health and
OL,20,FSafety at Work Act 1974 in connection
OL,21,Fwith his death.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
